  "question": "What overall growth patterns and platform shifts are projected for the 2017–2022 period?",
  "status": "complete",
  "createdAt": "2026-09-21T16:20:40.991669Z",
  "completedAt": "2026-09-21T16:21:00.859948Z",
  "answers": {
    "vision": {
      "answer": "The global app market is projected to grow at roughly 14% annually from 2017 to 2022, with the Americas and EMEA slightly outpacing Asia Pacific. Third-party Android is expected to grow fastest (17.9% CAGR), followed by Google Play (13.7%) and iOS (12.2%), indicating a gradual shift toward Android platforms even though iOS remains the largest market segment.",
